usage:
Optional Extension configuration:
{"time":"[time:%H%M;Europe/Brussels]","mode":"rounded","accurate_past_threshold_minutes":35,"font_family":"bebas","font_size":0,"dimmed_color":"#383631","burn_in_shift_minutes":60}

mode rounded (default) selects the nearest five-minute phrase. mode minute-dots uses the preceding five-minute phrase and one to four filled corner dots for the remaining minutes. mode accurate uses a separate square face to spell every minute, such as IT IS THIRTEEN MINUTES PAST FIVE. accurate_past_threshold_minutes applies only to accurate mode; it defaults to 35 and accepts values from 30 through 44. The button's resolved background and text colors are always used for the clock face and highlighted words. font_size 0 automatically selects the largest bundled font that fits the selected letter matrix. Use one of 12, 14, 18, 24, 32, 36, or 48 to prefer a specific size; it reduces automatically if necessary.
